                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Drastically worse than I remember it being. Completely bizarre plot, puzzles that make little sense, new clunky game mechanics that are only used for maybe 2 minutes each, somehow even worse voice acting than both previous games combined. I was also convinced at multiple points that I'd accidentally clicked and skipped a cut scene because the plot is so choppy it feels like huge chunks of the story are missing. Having finished replaying the series again (except for Sam Peters which barely counts as part of the series) I can safely say it's best to just stick to the first one.",
